         "My passion is working with companies that disrupt, innovate, and improve the way we engage the world around us. I want to see the spark that happens when you combine true passion with the right people, skills and resources to transform ideas into meaningful new businesses.\n\nI am a creative, versatile, and determined entrepreneurial problem solver with 15+ years of experience in finance, marketing, strategy, operations and start-ups. I have a motivating management style with a track record of recruiting and retaining valuable talent and creating accountable, productive and energetic teams. These intensive experiences are underpinned by the rigorous foundation of a Chicago Booth MBA. My expertise also includes: \n\n• Identifying, structuring, and executing operational and strategic initiatives \n• Building comprehensive financial models\n• Analyzing quantitative and qualitative data\n• Conducting industry, channel, and competitive research\n• Fostering and managing internal and external relationships\n\nI am excited to drive growth and create positive returns on innovation. \n\nSpecialties: Strategy, finance and financial modeling, strategic planning, data analytics, CRM, new business development, market research and analysis, leadership, internal and external communications, and thinking outside the box ",
