         "I am Founder and Principal of Orange Vista LLC, a market research consultancy mainly focused on driving innovation in the healthcare, education and social sectors. Twenty years ago, I began my career in the financial services industry and spent nearly a decade in a variety of strategic and operational roles in the US, Europe and Africa. In late 2015, I decided to pivot and learn more about technology, data and innovation. Shortly thereafter, I started Orange Vista because I wanted to leverage my background working in unique environments to provide businesses with actionable insights that would foster better decision making. I am a huge supporter of the innovation economy and I regularly speak on market research topics at universities and business incubators. \n\nI'm interested in the following:\n1) Cultural & Demographic Adaptation to New Technologies & Delivery Channels\n2) The Lifecycle of an Entrepreneur & Commercializing Innovation \n3) Helping \"Creative people\" frame a business strategy and implement it \n4) Helping \"Business people\" tap into their creative side and apply effectual logic \n5) The on-demand economy, content marketing & the digitally connected world \n\nWant to chat? Feel free to shoot a note to info@orangevista.com ",
